hadiths[108]{hadithnumber,text}:
"7055","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aur bakri ko agar tu us par reham kare to Allah tujh par reham karega."
"7056","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Zameen par koi momin aisa nahi magar main logon mein sab se zyada us ka haq-daar hoon. Pas tum mein se jo koi qarz ya be-sahaara ahl-o-ayal chhod jaye to main us ka sarparast hoon, aur tum mein se jo maal chhod jaye to wo us ke asaba ko milega, jo bhi ho."
"7057","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Mujhe umeed hai ke tum jannat walon ka aadha hissa hoge, kyunke jannat mein sirf musalman jaan hi dakhil hogi. Aur tum ahl-e-shirk ke muqable mein is safed baal ki tarah ho jo kaale saand ki khaal par ho, ya us kaale baal ki tarah jo laal saand ki khaal par ho."
"7058","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Beshak Ghifar, Aslam, Muzaina aur Juhaina, aur jo bhi Muzaina se hain, qayamat ke din Allah ke haan Asad, Tayy aur Ghatafan se behtar honge."
"7059","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Saad bin Muaz ke rumal jannat mein is se behtar hain."
"7060","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Tum mein se kisi par aisa din zaroor aayega jab mujhe dekhna, phir mujhe dekhna, us ke liye us ke ahl-o-maal se zyada pyara hoga."
"7061","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Aal-e-Muhammad ke paas na ek sa'a anaj maujood tha aur na ek sa'a khajoor, jab subah hui."
"7062","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Koi banda aisa nahi jo iman laye aur phir seedhe raaste par qaim rahe magar Allah use jannat ke raaste par chala dega. Aur mujhe umeed hai ke jannat mein koi dakhil nahi hoga yahan tak ke tum aur tumhari aulad mein se jo nek hon, jannat mein apne gharon mein bas jao. Aur beshak mere Rab ne mujh se waada kiya hai ke meri ummat se sattar hazaar logon ko bina hisab jannat mein dakhil karega."
"7063","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Is ummat mein se koi yahudi ya nasrani aisa nahi jo mere baare mein sune phir mar jaye aur us cheez par iman na laaye jo le kar main bheja gaya, magar wo dozakh walon mein se hoga."
"7064","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak saqt hone wala bachcha apni maa ko apni naaf ki rassi se jannat ki taraf kheenchega, jab us ne is par sawab ki niyat ki ho."
"7065","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Wo chadar jo us ne Khaybar ke din ghanimat ke maal mein se li thi aur jis tak taqseem nahi pahunchi thi, ab wo us par aag ban kar bhadak rahi hai."
"7066","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Beshak mere hauz ke bartan andheri aur saaf raat mein aasman ke sitare aur sayyaron ki tadaad se bhi zyada hain. Jannat ke bartan hain; jo un se piye wo kabhi pyaasa nahi hoga. Us mein jannat se do naale behte hain; jo us se piye wo pyaasa nahi hoga. Us ki chaurai us ki lambai ke barabar hai — Uman se Ayla tak. Us ka pani doodh se zyada safed aur shehad se zyada mitha hai."
"7067","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Main zaroor kuch logon ko apne hauz se hataunga jaise ajnabi oont ko hauz se hataya jata hai."
"7068","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Main tum dono ke darmiyan Allah ki kitab ke mutabiq faisla karunga: laundi aur bakriyan tumhe wapas kar di jati hain; tumhare bete ke liye sau kode aur ek saal ki jila-watani hai, aur is aadmi ki biwi par rajm hai. Ae Unais! Subah is aadmi ki biwi ke paas jao; agar wo iqrar kar le to use rajm kar do."
"7069","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Tum mein se koi apni rassi le kar apni peeth par lakriyan laaye, ye us se behtar hai ke kisi aadmi ke paas jaye aur us se maange, wo use de ya na de."
"7070","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Tum zaroor neki ka hukm do aur burai se roko, warna Allah tum par apni taraf se azab bhej dega, phir tum us se dua karoge to wo tumhari dua qubool nahi karega."
"7071","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Qayamat ke din tum se in neamaton ke baare mein zaroor pucha jayega. Bhookh ne tumhe tumhare gharon se nikala, phir tum wapas nahi gaye yahan tak ke ye neamat tumhe mili."
"7072","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Maine iraada kiya ke lakriyan jama karne ka hukm dun, phir namaz ka hukm dun ke us ke liye azan di jaye, phir ek aadmi ko hukm dun ke wo logon ki imamat kare, phir main un logon ke paas jaun aur un ke gharon ko un par jala dun. Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Agar un mein se kisi ko maloom ho ke use moti haddi ya do achhe khur milenge to wo Isha ki namaz mein zaroor aayega."
"7073","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Agar tum apne gharon mein usi haalat mein rehte jo mere paas rehte ho to farishte tum se musafaha karte aur apne paron se tumhe saaya karte, lekin ae Hanzala! waqt waqt ki baat hai."
"7074","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Agar tum gunah na karte to Allah tumhe le jata aur aise log laata jo gunah karte aur Allah se maghfirat maangte to wo unhe maaf kar deta."
"7075","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Agar mominon mein se kuch aise log na hote jin ki nafsen is baat ko gawar nahi maanti ke wo mujh se peeche reh jayen, aur mujhe unhe sawari dene ke liye kuch na milta, to main Allah ki raah mein kisi lashkar se peeche na rehta. Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Mujhe pasand hai ke main Allah ki raah mein qatl kiya jaun, phir zinda kiya jaun, phir qatl kiya jaun, phir zinda kiya jaun, phir qatl kiya jaun, phir zinda kiya jaun, phir qatl kiya jaun."
"7076","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Logon par aisa waqt zaroor aayega jab qatil ko maloom nahi hoga ke us ne kis cheez ke liye qatl kiya aur maqtool ko maloom nahi hoga ke kis cheez ke liye use qatl kiya gaya."
"7077","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Ibn Maryam tum mein zaroor nazil honge, insaf karne wale hakim aur aadil imam ban kar; wo salib ko zaroor todenge, suar ko zaroor qatl karenge, jizya zaroor hata denge aur maal khoob bahayenge yahan tak ke koi use qubool na karega; aur ek sajda duniya aur us ki tamam cheezon se behtar hoga."
"7078","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Ibn Maryam Fajj-ur-Rawha se hajj ya umrah ke liye zaroor ahram bandhenge, ya dono ko mila denge."
"7079","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Torat mein na Injil mein na Zabur mein na Furqan mein us jaisi koi cheez nazil nahi hui — yani Umm-ul-Quran — aur wo Masani mein se saat aayatein hain aur wo Quran-e-Azeem hai jo mujhe ata kiya gaya."
"7080","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Koi aadmi apni biwi ko apne bistar par bulaye aur wo inkar kar de, to aasman wala us se naraaz ho jata hai yahan tak ke us ka shohar us se raazi ho jaye."
"7081","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Tum jannat mein dakhil nahi hoge jab tak iman na lao, aur tum iman nahi laoge jab tak aapas mein muhabbat na karo. Kiya main tumhe aisi cheez na bataun jis se tum muhabbat karne lago? Apne darmiyan salam phailao."
"7082","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Duniya khatam nahi hogi yahan tak ke aadmi qabr par guzre aur us par lot-pot kar kahe: Kaash main is qabr wale ki jagah hota! Aur us ki ye khwahish deen ki wajah se nahi hogi, balke bala aur aazmaish ki wajah se hogi."
"7083","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Qayamat qaim nahi hogi yahan tak ke darinde insan se baat karenge, aur aadmi se us ke kode ka sar aur joote ka tasma baat karega, aur us ki raan us ke baad us ke ghar walon ke baare mein jo kuch hoga us ki khabar degi."
"7084","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Tum mein se koi momin nahi hoga jab tak main us ke liye us ke baap aur us ki aulad se zyada pyara na ho jaun."
"7085","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Koi banda momin nahi hoga jab tak apne bhai ke liye wohi khair na chaahe jo apne liye chahta hai."
"7086","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Koi banda momin nahi hoga jab tak apne padosi ke liye wohi na chaahe jo apne liye chahta hai."
"7087","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: ... Ae logon! Jis ne mere chacha ko aziyat di us ne mujhe aziyat di, kyunke aadmi ka chacha us ke baap ke barabar hai."
"7088","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us zaat ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai! Koi Allah ki raah mein zakhm nahi khata — aur Allah behtar janta hai kaun Allah ki raah mein zakhm khata hai — magar wo qayamat ke din is tarah aayega ke us ka zakhm khoon ke rang mein bahta hoga aur us ki khushbu kasturi ki khushbu hogi."
"7089","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Beshak tu Allah ki zameen mein sab se behtar zameen hai aur mujhe Allah ki zameen mein sab se pyari zameen hai. Agar mujhe tujh se nikalna na hota to main kabhi na nikalta."
"7090","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Main umeed rakhta hoon ke main tum mein Allah se sab se zyada darrne wala aur tum mein sab se zyada janne wala hoon ke kis cheez se parhez karna hai."
"7091","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Main din mein sattar martaba se zyada Allah se maghfirat maangta hoon aur us ki taraf tauba karta hoon."
"7092","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Main namaz mein bachche ke rone ki aawaz sunta hoon to namaz halki kar deta hoon, is dar se ke us ki maa ko fitna na ho jaye."
"7093","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Tum mein se kisi ka apne ghar walon ke maamle mein apni qasam par ade rehna Allah ke haan us kaffara ada karne se zyada gunah hai jo Allah ne us par farz kiya hai."
"7094","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Agar tumhare zariye kisi ek aadmi ko hidayat mil jaye to ye tumhare liye surkh oonton se behtar hai."
"7095","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Allah apne mehboob ko aag mein nahi dalega."
"7096","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Duniya Allah ke haan is se bhi zyada haqeer hai jo ye tumhare paas hai."
"7097","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Allah apne bande ki tauba par us aadmi se bhi zyada khush hota hai jo safar mein zameen ke bayaban mein ho, ek darakht ki chhaon mein utar kar so jaye, phir uth kar apni sawari na paye; wo ek oonchi jagah par chadhe aur dekhe to kuch nazar na aaye; phir doosri jagah jaye aur ooncha ho kar dekhe to kuch na dekhe; phir kahe: Main apni usi jagah wapas jaunga jahan main tha aur wahan rahunga yahan tak ke mar jaun. Pas wo gaya to achanak us ki sawari apni lagam ghaseete hue maujood thi. To Allah apne bande ki tauba par is aadmi se bhi zyada khush hota hai jo apni sawari par khush hua."
"7098","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Allah qayamat ke din is patthar — yani Hajar-e-Aswad — ko zaroor uthayega, us ki do aankhein hongi jin se wo dekhega aur ek zabaan hogi jis se wo bolega; wo har us shakhs ke baare mein gawahi dega jo use haq ke saath chhuyega."
"7099","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Ibn Maryam zaroor nazil honge aadil hakim ban kar; wo salib ko zaroor todenge, suar ko zaroor qatl karenge, jizya zaroor hata denge, oontniyan zaroor chhod di jayengi ke un par koi mehnat nahi karega, aur bughz, dushmani aur hasad zaroor jaate rahenge, aur maal ki taraf bulaya jayega to koi use qubool nahi karega."
"7100","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Duniya aakhirat ke muqable mein sirf aisi hai jaise tum mein se koi apni ye ungli samandar mein daale, phir dekhe ke wo kya le kar wapas aayi."
"7101","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Mere baad tum apne oopar mujh se zyada insaaf karne wala koi nahi paaoge."
"7102","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo momin nahi, Allah ki qasam! Wo momin nahi, Allah ki qasam! Wo momin nahi jis ka padosi us ki buraiyon se mehfooz na ho."
"7103","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Aaj ke din ke baad main kisi se hadiya qubool nahi karunga, magar ye ke wo muhajir Quraishi ho, ya Ansari, ya Dausi, ya Saqafi ho."
"7104","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aur kaunsi bimari bukhl se zyada tabah karne wali hai?"
"7105","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Dono Eid ke din har baligh aurat par bahar nikalna wajib hai."
"7106","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wajib ho gaya. Tum zameen par gawah ho."
"7107","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhari sadaqa saabit ho gayi aur tumhara bagh tumhe wapas mil gaya."
"7108","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kaash main apne un bhaiyon se milta jo mujh par iman laye aur mujhe dekha nahi."
"7109","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Momin ki lagatar beemari us ke gunahon ka kaffara hai."
"7110","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat se ghalti, bhool aur us cheez ka bojh utha diya gaya hai jis par use majboor kiya jaye."
"7111","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mere Rab ne mujh se waada kiya hai ke meri ummat se sattar hazaar log bina hisab aur bina azab ke jannat mein dakhil honge; har hazaar ke saath sattar hazaar aur mere Rab ki mutthiyon mein se teen mutthiyan."
"7112","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah ke mehman teen hain: ghazi, haji aur umrah karne wala."
"7113","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Darhiyan badhao aur moonchein katao."
"7114","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apni darhiyon ko badhao aur apni moonchein chhoti karo."
"7115","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zohar ki namaz ka waqt jab sooraj dhal jaye aur aadmi ka saya us ke qad ke barabar ho jaye, jab tak Asr ka waqt na aaye; Asr ka waqt jab tak sooraj zard na ho jaye; Maghrib ka waqt jab tak shafaq ghayab na ho; Isha ka waqt aadhi raat tak; Fajr ka waqt tuloo-e-fajr se sooraj nikalne tak. Pas jab sooraj nikal aaye to namaz se ruk jao, kyunke wo shaitan ke do singon ke darmiyan nikalta hai."
"7116","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe tumhare shar se bacha liya gaya aur tumhe us ke shar se bacha liya gaya."
"7117","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Sharmgah ko bandhne wali cheez aankhein hain; pas jo so jaye wo wuzu kare."
"7118","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aulad-e-Adam ke tamam log qayamat ke din mere jhande ke neeche honge aur main sab se pehle hoon jis ke liye jannat ka darwaza khola jayega."
"7119","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aadmi ki aulad us ki kamai se hai, aur wo us ki behtareen kamai hai; pas un ke maalon mein se khao."
"7120","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zina se paida hone wala bachcha teenon mein se badtar hai."
"7121","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aaj raat mere yahan ek ladka paida hua, maine us ka naam apne baap Ibrahim ke naam par rakha."
"7122","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aur tum mein se koi aisa kyun na kare? Beshak koi jaan aisi nahi jo paida ki gayi ho magar Allah hi us ka paida karne wala hai."
"7123","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mujhe duniya se kya wasta, aur mujhe naqsh o nigaar se kya wasta?"
"7124","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum shahadat sirf usi ko samajhte ho jo Allah ki raah mein qatl ho? Beshak tumhare shahidon ki tadaad kam hai. Allah ki raah mein qatl hona shahadat hai, pet ki beemari shahadat hai, jalna shahadat hai, doobna shahadat hai, makan ke neeche dab kar marne wala shahadat hai, pehlu ki beemari se marne wala shahadat hai, aur wo aurat jo haamla ho kar mar jaye wo bhi shahadat hai."
"7125","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhe kya maloom ke wo ruqya hai? Tum ne theek kiya; maal baant lo aur mere liye bhi apne saath ek hissa rakho."
"7126","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhe kya maloom? Shayad Allah ne Badr walon par nazar daal kar farmaya: Jo chaho karo, maine tumhe maaf kar diya."
"7127","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya Aqeel ne hamare liye koi makan chhoda hai?"
"7128","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya oont oontniyon ke siwa kuch aur jannte hain?"
"7129","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Waih Ammar! Use baghawat karne wala giroh qatl karega; wo unhe jannat ki taraf bulayega aur wo use dozakh ki taraf bulayenge."
"7130","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Waih tum par! Beshak hijrat ka maamla sakht hai. Kya tumhare paas oont hain jin ki sadaqa ada karte ho? Pas samundar ke us paar se bhi amal karte raho, beshak Allah tumhare amal mein se kuch bhi zaya nahi karega."
"7131","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Waih tum par! Mere baad kafir na ban jao ke tum mein se kuch log doosron ki gardanein kaatne lagein."
"7132","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wail hai ediyon ke liye aag se."
"7133","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wail hai ediyon aur pairon ki talwon ke liye aag se."
"7134","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wail hai pairon ki ediyon ke pichhle hisson ke liye aag se."
"7135","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wail hai Arab ke liye us shar se jo qareeb aa gaya; kaamyab hua wo jis ne apna haath rok liya."
"7136","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wail hai us shakhs ke liye jo baat karte waqt jhoot bolta hai taake us se log hans dein; us ke liye wail hai, us ke liye wail hai."
"7137","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wail hai zyada maal jama karne walon ke liye, siwaye us ke jo maal ko is tarah aur is tarah kharch kare."
"7138","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wail hai aurton ke liye do surkh cheezon se: sona aur kesar se ranga hua kapda."
"7139","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Waih tum par! Kya main zameen walon mein sab se zyada is baat ka haq-daar nahi ke Allah se darun?"
"7140","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Waih tum par! Tum ne apne saathi ki gardan kaat di. Tum mein se jo bhi apne bhai ki tareef karna chahe to zaroor kahe: Main falane ko aisa samajhta hoon, aur Allah hi us ka haqeeqi jaanne wala hai; main Allah ke saamne kisi ki paakizgi ka dawa nahi karta. Main use aisa aisa samajhta hoon, agar wo is baat ko janta ho."
"7141","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Waih tum par! Jab main insaf na karun to kaun insaf karega? Beshak main tabahi aur khasare mein hota agar main insaf na karta."
"7142","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bachchi ko zinda dafan karne wali aur zinda dafan ki gayi dono aag mein hain."
"7143","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bachchi ko zinda dafan karne wali aur zinda dafan ki gayi dono aag mein hain, magar ye ke dafan karne wali Islam pa le aur musalman ho jaye."
"7144","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Akela aadmi shaitan hai, do shaitan hain, aur teen ek rakb hain."
"7145","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Baap jannat ke darwazon mein se darmiyani darwaza hai."
"7146","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Witr raat mein hai."
"7147","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Witr har musalman par haq hai; jis ka ji chahe saat rakat witr parhe, jis ka ji chahe paanch, jis ka ji chahe teen, aur jis ka ji chahe ek; aur jo majboor ho wo ishare se parh le."
"7148","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Witr aakhri raat ki ek rakat hai."
"7149","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Chhipkali fasiq hai."
"7150","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wazan Makkah walon ka wazan hai aur mikyal Madina walon ka mikyal hai."
"7151","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Waseela Allah ke haan ek darja hai jis ke oopar koi darja nahi; pas Allah se maango ke mujhe waseela ata kare."
"7152","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wuzu iman ka aadha hissa hai.. ..."
"7153","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wuzu us cheez se hai jo aag ne pakai ho."
"7154","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wuzu us cheez se hai jo aag ne chhui ho."
"7155","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wuzu us cheez se hai jo aag ne chhui ho, agarche wo aqit ka tukra ho."
"7156","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wuzu us se pehle ke gunahon ko maaf karta hai, phir namaz nafl ban jati hai."
"7157","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wala nasab ke rishte ki tarah ek rishta hai; wo becha nahi jata aur hadiya nahi diya jata."
"7158","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wala us ka hai jo azad kare."
"7159","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wala us ka hai jis ne chandi di aur ehsan kiya."
"7160","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aulad dil ka phal hai, aur wo buzdili, kanjoosi aur gham ka bais hai."
"7161","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aulad bistar wale ki hai aur zina karne wale ke liye patthar hai."
"7162","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aulad baap ki kamai se hai."
